            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To scrub? (ಉಜ್ಜು, ujju.) To bring? (ತರು, taru.) To carry away? (ಒಯ್ಯು, oyyu.) To hold? (ಹಿಡಿ, hiḍi.) To let go? (ಬಿಡು, biḍu.) To swallow? (ನುಂಗು, nuṅgu.) To spread out? (ಹಾಸು, hāsu.) To fold? (ಮಡಚು, maḍacu.) To iron? (ಇಸ್ತ್ರಿ ಮಾಡು, istri māḍu.) To change? (ಬದಲಿಸು, badalisu.) To get well? (ಗುಣವಾಗು, guṇavāgu.) To itch? (ತುರಿಸು, turisu.) To die? (ಸಾಯು, sāyu.) To finish? (ಮುಗಿಸು, mugisu.) To start? (ಶುರು ಮಾಡು, śuru māḍu.) To postpone? (ಮುಂದೂಡು, mundūḍu.) To explain? (ವಿವರಿಸು, vivarisu.) To pass? (ಪಾಸಾಗು, pāsāgu.) To remember? (ನೆನಪಿಡು, nenapiḍu.) To print? (ಮುದ್ರಿಸು, mudrisu.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
